Chaba-ba!

270
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:47,280
Whoa, pathetic.

271
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:49,360
That's got nothing on.

272
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,620
My strong... Iron body!

273
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:53,990
Huh?

274
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,980
Is that all you got?

275
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:03,182
That was the weakest punch ever.

276
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:22,497
All your punches are lazy and flat.

277
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:28,837
No way your punches are
the lazy and flabby ones!

278
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:31,877
They're like flimsy
underpowered paper punches.

279
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:34,780
Yours are flimsy underpants punches.

280
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:40,677
Underpowered, not underpants!

281
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,289
You're underpowered pants!

282
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:43,210
Oh, yeah?

283
00:17:43,293 --> 00:17:44,123
Well, you're a stupid bra!

284
00:17:44,206 --> 00:17:46,720
Shut up, pair of socks! Long jaws!

285
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:47,917
Boxer briefs!

286
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:48,880
White cloths!

287
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:00,920
Get off me!

288
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,826
Shut your chains, purse hole!

289
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,420
Oh, all right.

290
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,621
Finally made it into the kitchen.

291
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:09,360
Whoa, jackpot.

292
00:18:09,620 --> 00:18:11,502
Look at the size of that fridge.

293
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:17,680
Hey, he changed.

294
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:20,920
Gorilla Devil Fruit
Powers, maybe? Damn it.

295
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:23,220
My three minutes are already up.

296
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:26,366
I used the rumble ball
too early in the fight.

297
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:28,180
What now?

298
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:32,240
Yo-yo!

299
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:37,560
You will now disappear from this world.

300
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,720
Finishing bro!

301
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:44,320
First time!

302
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:47,540
Yes, it has a lock!

303
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,980
Champa! Kumadori!

304
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,500
All right!

305
00:18:52,940 --> 00:18:55,117
I locked him up! Why, you...

306
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,700
Hey, hold on a second.

307
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:59,557
I got some business with
that fridge, Gorilla Man.

308
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,470
Ah!

309
00:19:00,553 --> 00:19:02,520
CP9 and that jerk! It's Franky!

310
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:04,037
I'm on your side, remember?

311
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,337
Who are you calling Gorilla Man?

312
00:19:05,420 --> 00:19:06,479
Damn, you're slow!

313
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:07,830
Listen up.

314
00:19:07,913 --> 00:19:08,976
I'm just like Luffy.

315
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:11,317
I haven't forgiven you
for what you did to us.

316
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,300
We lost a member of our crew.

317
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:17,520
And it's all your fault, you bastard!

318
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:19,269
Give us our own salt back!

319
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,817
What are you talking about?

320
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:22,253
You were just with him!

321
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:24,920
Look, forget about all that for now.

322
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:27,531
Do you want to get Nico Robin back or not?

323
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:29,420
I do! Robin!

324
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:33,857
Then turn around, get three bottles of cola
out of that fridge and give them to me.

325
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:36,157
That'll bring me back up to full power.

326
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,070
After that,

327
00:19:37,153 --> 00:19:40,737
I'll be able to pound these jerks into
the ground and take their keys no problem.

328
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:43,077
What kind of an idiot
gets stronger from cola?

329
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,580
I do! Don't judge me!

330
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:51,000
How long do you two plan on
keeping up this comedy act?

331
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:54,977
You want to stop for a little tea
party in the middle of a fight?

332
00:19:55,060 --> 00:19:57,260
That's not only stupid, it's rude!

333
00:19:58,100 --> 00:19:59,100
Secret technique?

334
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:04,100
No! Now thrashing! No!

335
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,181
Shababababababa!

336
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:11,600
Beats left!

337
00:20:19,740 --> 00:20:21,640
You call that an attack?

338
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:27,360
This is terrible! He's right!

339
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:28,997
He's fighting on our side now!

340
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:29,910
I bet he's right!

341
00:20:29,993 --> 00:20:30,823
I better help him!

342
00:20:30,906 --> 00:20:31,736
Shabba ba ba ba ba!

343
00:20:32,740 --> 00:20:36,446
If I open and close the door
really fast, then he can't escape!

344
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,840
Now! Yo-yo!

345
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:43,460
The door has suddenly opened!

346
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:45,590
Yes!

347
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:46,850
Franky!

348
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:48,050
Catch!

349
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,720
You're a lifesaver!

350
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,700
Oh, feelin' fresh!

351
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,150
Oh!

352
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:04,280
Uh, what the?

353
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:08,220
Fresh is the best!

354
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:09,840
Vegetable punch, go!

355
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,440
Solid beast.

356
00:21:14,020 --> 00:21:16,280
That was vegetable juice, jerk!

357
00:21:17,660 --> 00:21:20,157
How am I supposed to
power up on that crap?

358
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,860
Cola, damn it! Cola!

359
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:24,436
I just thought he was really thirsty.

360
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:25,880
Yo-yo-yay!

361
00:21:26,020 --> 00:21:27,260
The door!

362
00:21:28,100 --> 00:21:29,920
Coming out, Jack! Thanks, man!

363
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:35,100
My heart is failing!

364
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:39,180
And now...

365
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:41,680
I'll sit a spell.

366
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:45,397
I've tended to the fields
enough for one day, neighbor.

367
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,157
Let's stop all this fighting.

368
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:50,300
Kick our feet up, have
ourselves a nice cup of tea.

369
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:52,060
Tea does a body good.

370
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:54,740
That's not cola either, dumbass!

371
00:21:56,180 --> 00:21:58,480
He is the funniest thing ever.

372
00:21:59,300 --> 00:22:00,130
Hey!

373
00:22:00,213 --> 00:22:01,097
Stop looking at me with that.

374
00:22:01,180 --> 00:22:05,197
I wonder what else might happen when I
give him other drinks, Vice little bastard.

375
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:06,920
Get it right, Antlerhead!

376
00:22:07,180 --> 00:22:09,817
So, the change doesn't depend
on what mood you're in?

377
00:22:09,900 --> 00:22:11,100
Cola only now!

378
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:13,500
There it is.

379
00:22:13,620 --> 00:22:14,477
The real stuff.

380
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:15,795
That's cola for sure.

381
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,580
Come to papa.

382
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:24,657
I don't know what's going on, but there's
no way I'm letting you get what you want.

383
00:22:24,740 --> 00:22:25,570
Drop this key!

384
00:22:27,420 --> 00:22:28,440
No, Franky!

385
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:40,890
Super!

386
00:23:08,460 --> 00:23:09,560
Oh, come on.

387
00:23:09,760 --> 00:23:13,642
It's not like anything's gonna
change because you drank some cola.

388
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:16,200
Get ready.

389
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:18,780
Chop, for what?

390
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,097
Another round of your flimsy punches?

391
00:23:21,180 --> 00:23:22,121
Give me a break.

392
00:23:24,940 --> 00:23:25,770
Strong...

393
00:23:25,853 --> 00:23:26,683
Hammer!

394
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,017
Go, baby!

395
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:31,560
Aaaaaaaaaah!

396
00:23:43,620 --> 00:23:45,020
Amazing!

397
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,560
Oh, you were right.

398
00:24:08,080 --> 00:24:10,380
My punches were pretty flimsy.

399
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:13,680
But don't worry, that's all gonna change.
